        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "<p>It's been well talked about that the Opel brand is no longer available in Australia, after just 12 months on the Australian New Car market, so I thought I should start taking pictures of the one's that are around the place. \n</p><p>The Astra was by far the most popular model, with less than 2,000 sold in that 12 months!\n</p><p>Some Astra models will return to the Australian and this time, to the New Zealand market, badged as Holden's once again, in 2015! \n</p>\nThe same alloy wheel trims are also found on the Holden Cruze CDX!",
          "source": "commons-desc-page"
        },
